// Shady Sands, laid out after the original's maps SHADYE (east part) and SHADYW (west part).
// Our cell is a 2×2 square of hexes; walls, buildings and doors are where they are in the original, extras simplified (walls in the original
// are double; ours are a single wall cell). Top view of the original: `node tools/map-view.ts SHADYE 0 12 2 --grid`.
// Between the parts runs a diagonal road, as in the original: the edge of one map (letter Y) leads to the other. From the wasteland you enter the west
// part through the west gate (letter X). All critters are peaceful (kind: 'npc') with the original's scripts.
// Extraction settings for each level: `tools/levels/` (`node tools/levels/check.ts` re-extracts and compares with this file).
